sequenceDiagram
  participant OPS as Operator/flag
  participant BF as Backfill worker
  participant CDB as Customer DBs (owner-operated export)
  participant DN as Downstream load pool (C=20, ~1 min/load)
  participant IDX as Pending Update Index

  OPS->>BF: enable backfill (rate limit C, checkpoint dir)
  loop Batches until complete
    BF->>CDB: enumerate next engagement batch
    BF->>DN: bounded loads (in-flight <= C)
    DN-->>BF: template_version per engagement
    BF->>IDX: idempotent row writes
    BF->>BF: external checkpoint advance
  end
  Note over BF,IDX: kill process at any point then restart resumes from checkpoint. Never exceeds C. Haltable within minutes
  OPS->>BF: halt flag
  BF->>BF: stop admission, flush in-flight, persist checkpoint
